# GitHub bus — always aligned

**Bus = `origin/main`.** Mac Cursor, Cloud Agent and iPhone share the same tree. Devices do not need to be online together.

## Every session (Mac and Cloud)

1. Run `./deploy/check_github_before_work.sh` before editing (hooks also run it).
2. If it pulled commits, say so in Italian.
3. If it warns about a dirty tree, say so and do not overwrite local edits.

## After finished work

1. Commit + push.
2. Run `./deploy/land_on_main.sh` so work lives on `main`, not only on a draft PR.
3. Do not tell Alessandro “the other device will see it after you merge” as the normal path — land it yourself.

## Non-goals

- Live chat sync between Cursors
- Syncing uncommitted files
- Syncing `.env` / secrets
- Copying Minda Pi/hub deploy unless this project has those devices
